          },
          {
            "id": 2802785,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I think my kids would enjoy that. What about any advice for parents on how to encourage their children to read more?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2802786,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I think my kids would enjoy that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 295.44,
                  "from": 293.44,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2802794,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "What about any advice for parents on how to encourage their children to read more?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 301.14502,
                  "from": 295.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2802810,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Well, this is something I get asked about a lot. There are so many distractions for kids these days that it can be hard to find time for reading. One thing I'd say is to make time to sit down with your child and share books with them. A lot of parents give up reading aloud to their children as soon as they learn to read independently, but this is a mistake. It's good to read more advanced books to them as it helps to develop their vocabulary.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2802811,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, this is something I get asked about a lot.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 304.505,
